# TURN relay for WebRTC connectivity on restrictive networks (symmetric NAT,
# mobile, corporate firewalls). Without TURN, peers behind such networks can't
# connect at all. See TDD.md §4.
#
# By default the app fetches live TURN credentials from the Metered REST API
# (key baked in src/network/peer/iceConfig.ts). Override here if you want a
# different Metered subdomain/key, or a fully custom TURN server.

# --- Option A: your own Metered account (fetches short-lived credentials) ---
# VITE_METERED_URL=https://<your-subdomain>.metered.live/api/v1/turn/credentials
# VITE_METERED_API_KEY=<your-metered-api-key>

# --- Option B: a single static TURN server (takes precedence over Metered) ---
# VITE_TURN_URL=turn:turn.example.com:3478
# VITE_TURN_USERNAME=
# VITE_TURN_CREDENTIAL=
